त्यागस्य च हृषीकेश पृथक्केशिनिषूदन ॥ १ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4434,\"bb\":3893,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3893/\",\"body_value\":\"arjuna uvāca
sannyāsasya mahā-bāho
tattvam icchāmi veditum
tyāgasya ca hṛṣīkeśa
pṛthak keśi-niṣūdana\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4435,\"bb\":3894,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3894/\",\"shadow_value\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca – Arjuna said; sannyāsasya – of renunciation; mahā-bāho – O mighty-armed one; tattvam – the truth; icchāmi – I wish; veditum – to understand; tyāgasya – of renunciation; ca – also; hṛṣīkeśa – O master of the senses; pṛthak – differently; keśi-niṣūdana – O killer of the Keśī demon.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna said\"},{\"word\":\"sannyāsasya\",\"translation\":\"of renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-bāho\",\"translation\":\"O mighty-armed one\"},{\"word\":\"tattvam\",\"translation\":\"the truth\"},{\"word\":\"icchāmi\",\"translation\":\"I wish\"},{\"word\":\"veditum\",\"translation\":\"to understand\"},{\"word\":\"tyāgasya\",\"translation\":\"of renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"hṛṣīkeśa\",\"translation\":\"O master of the senses\"},{\"word\":\"pṛthak\",\"translation\":\"differently\"},{\"word\":\"keśi-niṣūdana\",\"translation\":\"O killer of the Keśī demon\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4436,\"bb\":3895,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3895/\",\"body_value\":\"Arjuna said: O mighty-armed one, I wish to understand the purpose of renunciation [tyāga] and of the renounced order of life [sannyāsa], O killer of the Keśī demon, master of the senses.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4437,\"bb\":3896,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3896/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4438,\"bb\":3897,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3897/\",\"body_value\":\"As in the Second Chapter a synopsis of the whole subject matter was described, in the Eighteenth Chapter also the summary of all instruction is given. The purpose of life is indicated to be renunciation and attainment of the transcendental position above the three material modes of nature. Arjuna wants to clarify the two distinct subject matters of Bhagavad-gītā, namely renunciation (tyāga) and the renounced order of life (sannyāsa). Thus he is asking the meaning of these two words.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4439,\"bb\":3898,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/1/b3898/\",\"body_value\":\"Two words used in this verse to address the Supreme Lord – Hṛṣīkeśa and Keśi-niṣūdana – are significant. Hṛṣīkeśa is Kṛṣṇa, the master of all senses, who can always help us attain mental serenity. Arjuna requests Him to summarize everything in such a way that he can remain equipoised. Yet he has some doubts, and doubts are always compared to demons. He therefore addresses Kṛṣṇa as Keśi-niṣūdana. Keśī was a most formidable demon who was killed by the Lord; now Arjuna is expecting Kṛṣṇa to kill the demon of doubt.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.1\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.1\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static